```text
┌──────────────────────┐
│ ☰  Shiver        (HG)│  top bar (shop name hidden)
├──────────────────────┤
│ Overview             │  sidebar, only when ☰ is tapped
│ Reps                 │
│ Posts                │
├──────────────────────┤
│ page content         │
```

| Change | What it does |
| --- | --- |
| ☰ menu | Shows and hides the sidebar |
| One column | The sidebar moves above the page content |
| Metric cards | 2 per row instead of 4 |
| Overview row | Chart on top, Needs review underneath |
| Tables | Each cell stays on one line, and the table scrolls sideways inside its card |
